@node ChildDoc1 "Introduction"

     5D_Page - Introduction
  =============================

  5D_Page is a Replacement for the
  Internal Page of FAME.

@endnode
@node ChildDoc2 "Requirements"

     5D_Page - Requirements
  =============================

  o  an AMIGA (or Compatible - DRACO)
  o  FAME BBS

@endnode
@node ChildDoc3 "Installation"

    5D_Page - Installation (for FAME)
  ========================================

  Simply copy the Directories in this Archive into your BBS-
  Directory or use the Installer.
  TIP: You can run this Door RESIDENT !

@endnode
@node ChildDoc4 "History"

  5D_Page - History
  ========================

  v0.01 - First Release with 2 Designs

@endnode
@node ChildDoc5 "Tooltypes"

   5D_Comment - Tooltypes
  ==========================

  DEFAULT_STYLE=<NR>   NR = 1, 2, ... of Default Style
                       e.g.: DEFAULT_STYLE=2

  XX_EDITCONFIG        XX for the config name (in BBSCMD)
                       e.g.: PCONFIG_EDITCONFIG
                             ^^^^^^^^
@endnode
